        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "East of the bridge, in the old ruins of Tharbad. Red Eye cultists -- a dozen candles' worth of them, and their leader, the one they call the Voice, keeps the miller's boy close like a pet. Go careful, friend. Men who worship an Eye don't blink."
          }
        }
